# roc: a non-degenerate binary outcome and deterministic probability scores.
# Verbose level 2 asks the package to render both ROC and threshold charts.
# The sine term guarantees overlapping score distributions without randomness.
# nulldata creates the observation index series used below.
nulldata 96
series y = (index > 48)
series p = 0.35 + 0.30*y + 0.28*sin(index)
bundle result = roc(y, p, 2)
